              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
                  "vulnerability",
                  "security",
                  "MEDIUM"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-46601",
              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "golang.org/x/image/webp: golang.org/x/image/webp: Denial of Service via malformed VP8 chunk in WebP images"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The webp decoder can panic when processing a VP8 chunk with dimensions that do not match the canvas size."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-46601",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-46601\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: golang.org/x/image\nFixed Version: 0.43.0\nLink: [CVE-2026-46601](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-46601)\nThe webp decoder can panic when processing a VP8 chunk with dimensions that do not match the canvas size.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-46601**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|golang.org/x/image|0.43.0|[CVE-2026-46601](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-46601)|\n\nThe webp decoder can panic when processing a VP8 chunk with dimensions that do not match the canvas size."
