              "id": "CVE-2026-46602",
              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "The TIFF decoder does not set a limit on the size of tiles in tiled im ..."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The TIFF decoder does not set a limit on the size of tiles in tiled images, permitting a malicious or corrupt image containing a very large tile to cause unbounded memory consumption."
